			<aux name="maximum useful fertilizer per Mha">
				<doc>${External Parameter}
The range was defined based on observed values of fertilizer use per hectare of cropland for nitrogen in 2015 from the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO).

The upper bound of the range corresponds to the highest national value observed in the dataset, which is China, with 0.235 (MtN/year)/Mha. The lower bound was set to the global average, estimated at 0.065 (MtN/year)/Mha.

These values were obtained from the FAO statistical database FAOSTAT:
https://www.fao.org/faostat/en/#data</doc>
				<dimensions>
					<dim name="Run"/>
				</dimensions>
